OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland is facing collapse -    
OL,4,Awhat's gone wrong?                     
OL,6,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the   
OL,7,Fbalance as it faces a possible collapse
OL,8,Finto administration.                   
OL,10,FIts owner, US investment firm Gordon   
OL,11,FBrothers, put it up for sale in        
OL,12,FSeptember, but then rejected offers to 
OL,13,Fkeep the business afloat.              
OL,15,FPoundland has a major presence on the  
OL,16,FHigh Street, with 600 stores in the UK 
OL,17,Fand Ireland, where it trades under the 
OL,18,FDealz brand.                           
