OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland is facing collapse -    
OL,4,Awhat's gone wrong?                     
OL,6,FIf it were to collapse, the jobs of its
OL,7,F11,000 employees would be at risk, as  
OL,8,Fwell as potentially thousands of others
OL,9,Fat firms that supply the retailer.     
